are integer identities; the fixed-shell bound is decided over `ℚ` (the `(13, 2)` instance over `ℕ`); the
Fourier inversion is the matrix identity `W · (−W J) = 1` on `Fin (p − 1)`, from the relations of `FrcLedger.Fourier`.
